ass=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 42 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 4% of normal in February to March and 7% in November to December. In 2026 so far, March to April sits at 18% and June to July at 128%. Grid 15713 shows a preliminary July to August 2026 estimate of 77.2, and every grid had its driest year in 2011.</p>"}
